  id: cleansingthecurse
  displayName: Cleansing the Curse
  description: The altar stands, and Ingrid wants to show you why it matters. Bring the Cursed Essence the woods leave on everything you kill and set it in the basin; she tends it while it works, and what comes out is Purified Essence, the one thing the old ways spend.
  chain: Ingrid
  journalNotes: 'Use the altar and choose Purify: two Cursed Essence a batch. It only works while Ingrid has the Alchemist''s work, and a batch takes a while; it lands in your storage. Bring her the first of it.'
